concept fleeting_note {
  name     = "Fleeting Note"
  summary  = "A quick, throwaway capture of an idea before it is lost — raw input to be processed into permanent notes."
  related  = [permanent_note, atomic_note, zettelkasten]
  body {
    p <<BODY
      A fleeting note is a quick capture — a reminder jotted down so an idea is not lost before
      you can deal with it. It is rough, written for your present self, and disposable: its only
      job is to hold a thought until you process it. Left unprocessed, fleeting notes pile up
      and lose their meaning.
    BODY

    p <<BODY
      In wskill these are placed in the capture top level folder. These are designed for capturing ideas and information in a wskill while it is being created. These are then broken down into
      facts, entities, concepts or processes. Once a fleeting note is processed it is discarded.
    BODY
  }
}
